Subject: gitignore linker script

Ignore the linker script splat writes during setup.

---
 .gitignore | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index aaf2440..7738bdc 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -27,3 +27,6 @@ asm/
 
 # decomp-permuter work dirs (tools/permuter_setup.py)
 /nonmatchings/
+
+# splat writes its own linker script next to ours; the build uses linker_scripts/frontbin.ld
+linker_scripts/frontbin.splat.ld
